<tr><td colspan="9" style="vertical-align:middle;text-align:justify;text-indent:1cm">Hai b\xEAn x\xE1c nh\u1EADn kh\xF4ng c\xF2n quy\u1EC1n v\xE0 ngh\u0129a v\u1EE5 g\xEC li\xEAn quan \u0111\u1EBFn ph\u1EA7n di\u1EC7n t\xEDch s\u1EED d\u1EE5ng chung n\xEAu tr\xEAn.</td><td></td></tr>
<tr><td colspan="9" style="vertical-align:middle;text-align:justify;text-indent:1cm">C\xE1c kho\u1EA3n ti\u1EC1n li\xEAn quan \u0111\u1EBFn th\u1ECFa thu\u1EADn (n\u1EBFu c\xF3) \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c hai b\xEAn x\u1EED l\xFD nh\u01B0 sau:</td><td></td></tr>
<tr><td colspan="5" style="vertical-align:middle">B\xEAn A \u0111\xE3 thanh to\xE1n cho b\xEAn B s\u1ED1 ti\u1EC1n:</td><td colspan="3" style="font-weight:bold;vertical-align:middle">{tien_s_chung} \u0111\u1ED3ng</td><td colspan="2"></td></tr>
