<tr><td colspan="2" style="vertical-align:middle">\u0110\u1ECBa ch\u1EC9:</td><td colspan="24" style="vertical-align:middle;text-align:justify;text-indent:1cm">T\u1EA7ng 4, chung c\u01B0 C\xE1t T\u01B0\u1EDDng New , \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng L\xFD Th\xE1i T\u1ED5, ph\u01B0\u1EDDng Kinh B\u1EAFc, th\xE0nh ph\u1ED1 B\u1EAFc Ninh</td><td colspan="4"></td></tr>
