<tr><td colspan="9" style="vertical-align:middle;text-align:justify;text-indent:1cm">\u0110\u1ECBa ch\u1EC9 tr\u1EE5 s\u1EDF: T\u1EA7ng 4, chung c\u01B0 C\xE1t T\u01B0\u1EDDng New, \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng L\xFD Th\xE1i T\u1ED5, Ph\u01B0\u1EDDng Kinh B\u1EAFc, T\u1EC9nh B\u1EAFc Ninh, Vi\u1EC7t Nam.</td><td></td></tr>
