<tr><td colspan="9" style="font-style:italic;vertical-align:middle;text-align:justify;text-indent:1cm">- C\u0103n c\u1EE9 V\u0103n b\u1EA3n th\u1ECFa thu\u1EADn {so_vbtt_sc} C\xF4ng ty C\u1ED5 ph\u1EA7n C\xE1t T\u01B0\u1EDDng v\u1EDBi \xF4ng (b\xE0){ten_kh} v\xE0 \xF4ng (b\xE0) {vc_ten} k\xED ng\xE0y {ngay_vbtt_sc} </td><td></td></tr>
