<tr><td></td><td colspan="9" style="vertical-align:middle;text-align:justify"> Trong v\xF2ng 10 (m\u01B0\u1EDDi) ng\xE0y k\u1EC3 t\u1EEB ng\xE0y B\xEAn B\xE1n ph\xE1t h\xE0nh th\xF4ng b\xE1o b\xE0n giao C\u0103n h\u1ED9 g\u1EEDi B\xEAn Mua. B\xEAn Mua thanh to\xE1n cho B\xEAn B\xE1n 2% ph\xED b\u1EA3o tr\xEC l\xE0:</td><td colspan="2" style="font-weight:bold;vertical-align:middle">{phi_bao_tri} \u0111\u1ED3ng</td></tr>
